  <description>
    A 750ml spirits bottle (~24.5cm tall, ~7.7cm diameter), converted from a
    Blender-exported OBJ. Visual uses the detailed mesh; collision uses a
    cheap cylinder approximation for stable grasping physics in simulation.
  </description>
</model>
